{
  "title": "Cisco Jina \u2014 Webex CCR East / West",
  "description": "Gov region \u00d7 source and Webex/infra artifacts.",
  "tags": [
    "cisco",
    "jina",
    "workshop",
    "cisco-search-jina"
  ],
  "time_range": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "options": {
    "use_margins": true,
    "sync_colors": true,
    "sync_cursor": true,
    "sync_tooltips": false,
    "hide_panel_titles": false,
    "auto_apply_filters": true,
    "hide_panel_borders": false
  },
  "query": {
    "expression": "",
    "language": "kql"
  },
  "filters": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": "md-hero",
      "type": "markdown",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 7
      },
      "config": {
        "content": "## Webex / CCR East & West\n\n_Refreshed by **Workflows \u2192 Cisco Jina Workshop \u2014 Dashboard notes** (every 10 minutes)._\n\n**What you are looking at**\n- Gov East / West \u00d7 source coverage\n- Webex + infra artifact counts by region\n\n**Talking point:** CCR replicates; search locally \u2014 never cross the Gov boundary at query time.\n",
        "settings": {
          "open_links_in_new_tab": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kpi-gov",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "",
        "type": "metric",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| WHERE region LIKE \"us-gov-*\"\n| STATS gov_docs = COUNT(*)"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "gov_docs"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "kpi-webex",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "",
        "type": "metric",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| WHERE source IN (\"webex\", \"infra\")\n| STATS webex_infra_docs = COUNT(*)"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "webex_infra_docs"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webex-hm",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Gov region \u00d7 source",
        "type": "data_table",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| WHERE region LIKE \"us-gov-*\"\n| STATS docs = COUNT(*) BY region, source\n| SORT docs DESC"
        },
        "sampling": 1,
        "ignore_global_filters": false,
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "region"
          },
          {
            "column": "source"
          },
          {
            "column": "docs"
          }
        ],
        "styling": {
          "paging": 15
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webex-src",
      "type": "vis",
      "grid": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Webex + infra by region",
        "type": "pie",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM cisco-jina-corpus\n| WHERE source IN (\"webex\", \"infra\")\n| STATS docs = COUNT(*) BY region"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "column": "docs"
          }
        ],
        "group_by": [
          {
            "column": "region"
          }
        ],
        "styling": {
          "donut_hole": "m"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
